    "category": "测量",
    "image": "caliper-width-pass.png",
    "description": "按 28° 方向垂直扫描倾斜条带，使用演示比例 0.1 mm/px；这不是实物标定。",
    "expected": "15 组测宽约 8.04 mm；公差 8.0–8.1 mm，判定通过。",
    "steps": [
      {
        "operation": "plugin",
        "params": {
          "pluginId": "sieans-caliper",
          "pluginVersion": "1.0.0",
          "operatorId": "edge-width",
